WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Make room to swing. Helmet on. Adult to the side, clear of the bat.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Toss, track, contact. An adult gently tosses a soft ball into the hitting area.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Find your rhythm. Hit toward the net. Pause before the next toss.

